# Derived: every rank shifted 4 cores up the node.  Masks are clean whole cores
# and nothing is oversubscribed -- the ranks are just badly placed, which is the
# one class of pathology the mask rules cannot see.
#
# All three thresholds here are DERIVED from the probed topology crossed with the
# rank's actual core footprint (min_l3 / min_numa / min_sock).  Comparing NUMA or
# socket span against an absolute 1 instead would pass every rank narrow enough
# to fit one domain and never fire at all.
l3_straddle
numa_straddle
socket_straddle
